{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばもう7月だってのに、まだ蝉のなき声聞いてないぞ！\nまさか東京って蝉いないのか！？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バ、バカな... (´゜_,゜｀ )笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今日この頃、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックステーションに出演させて頂きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46としては、2度目！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には、初めてのMステですっo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、初登場のときに居れなくて、\nがんばれーって応援することしかできなかったので、とっても有難いです。(´。・v・。｀)おじぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その代わり、今日は、アンダーメンバーが単独ライブを開催しているので、皆がんばれー(> <)って思いながら\n責任を持って、精一杯頑張りたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見逃さずにねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくです＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってきたよ＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいっ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あじさいがキレイでした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鯉がね、くるくる回ってたの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/07/11/6100395/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒された〜(* ^_^ *)\nエレルギーチャージされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、日帰りでいいから、\nちょこっと遠くまで行ってみたいなっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高いビルが一切見えないとこまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\n質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)\nが、全然できてない件について（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かたじけない  | 柱 |ヽ(・´_｀・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いたらまた再開しようと思うので、気軽に質問してねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ私から質問っ！\n蝉のなき声聞いた？？？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}